ppcrlwimiwidth + ppcrldimimask -- JOINT KILL TABLE 3, POST-TABLE NOTES (a SEPARATE file, so PRETABLE.out's mtime
stays the order evidence).  Written 2026-09-12 after SCORES.txt's KILLTABLE3_DONE.

RESULT: 17 legs, 15 on prediction, zero mutant escapes.  Restore cmp-CLEAN, binary FRESH, sentinel cleared.
Both frozen instruments were `cmp'-identical to regress/ when this note was first written.  AFTER the 2026-09-12
adjudication pass both probes received HEADER/COMMENT-ONLY edits (rlwimi clause-(e) items 4-5 and its CONTROL
comment; rldimi's CONTRACT paragraph and its CONTROL comment); `diff' of each frozen copy against regress/,
filtered for lines that are not comments, shows docstring text only -- no executable line differs.  The shipped
probes execute exactly the instruments this table measured.

